[en.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_OPENMIND]
Openmind = Gullible

[en.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_OPENMIND_desc]
Poines are such magical creatures that they can change their minds in the time of a song, be fooled by any sweet words, and even be fooled into destroying their own homes or attacking their friends.\nIt’s hard to imagine how they survive and establish a stable political system in this world, but we’re already here.\nSo maybe the “open” mind is not very suitable for Ponyville... Worth a shot, but don’t get your hopes up too high.

[zh.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_OPENMIND]
开放=轻信

[zh.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_OPENMIND_desc]
小马们就是这样一种神奇的生物，他们可以在一首歌的时间内转变自己的主意，被任何花言巧语所迷惑，甚至被忽悠着毁掉自己的家或者攻击自己的朋友。\n很难想象他们是如何在这个世界上生存并建立起一个稳定的政治制度的，无论如何，我们已经在这了。\n所以也许，“开放”的思想并不是很适合小马谷... 值得一试，但是别抱太大希望。

